{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54028","headline":"後寄北堂颂（斯二一六五卷作「辞亲偈」） · 良价","name":"後寄北堂颂（斯二一六五卷作「辞亲偈」）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"不求名利不求儒（斯二一六五卷作「不好浮荣不好儒」），愿乐空门舍俗徒。\n烦恼尽时愁火灭，恩情断处爱河枯。\n六根戒定香风引，一念无生慧力扶。\n爲报北堂休怅望（斯二一六五卷作「忆念」），譬言死了譬如无。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"良价","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54028.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54028","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}